# TypeAssert: closed record annotation rejects dict with extra keys
# [@Any ...] wrapper bypasses inner typecheck so resolved_type is set on the outer TypeAssert.
# At runtime, validate_and_wrap_record rejects "extra" since the record is closed (no rest tail).
[@[name: String] [@Any [name: hello  extra: world]]]
===
[E011] type assertion failed: expected closed record (no extra fields), got record with unexpected field "extra"
